dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the link-row wire types, relation registry, ManagedTableBlock [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]primitive, Links table, companion paths, and bead link events.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python store, flag, and aggregate index[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after home, core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]store: create the artifact_links beta flag, the per-artifact truth [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]adapter, the rebuildable aggregate index, and the v1-to-v2 migration.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase artifact link and sase artifact read[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: ship sase artifact link add/list/rm and sase artifact read with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]doctor checks and retention protection.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rendered link tables, prompt-ref cites, and companions[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: project the Links and Referenced By tables, write prompt-ref [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cites, create companion markdown files, and exclude them from inventory.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bead link events, pages, and RELATED: migration[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]beads[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads: persist bead links in the event stream, render them on bead [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pages, and migrate RELATED: notes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ACE relation source for the link graph[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: add a links/linked_by relation source on every Artifacts pane [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without blocking the event loop.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Glossary, docs, skills, and agent adoption[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adopt[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli, render, beads, ace[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adopt: add the Artifact and Artifact Markdown File glossary terms, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite the skills and docs, and snapshot the relation registry.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-r8","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-r8.3","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-375db2694d8006d720376258a26f7d3e","started_at":"2026-08-20T10:16:12.910985+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"98228d510610e284fcecfd76289477b617ed8ec1338b13f9fdc4343eb29c29f3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-r8.2/chat.md","size_bytes":6249},"commits":{"digest":"167250552663e5eced75a8da97f429ffc7fe66cc470056eed9015de6813f83be","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-r8.2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-r8.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"258711f5610e42e2318b2a2e6c9fb5e2d7cbc275fc0d082e7aed2e50b91b4411","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-r8.2/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"a9b74f2e6905f14f0c9e70da954683e862e74f3ba5be0b54bf153e5a64a90990","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-r8.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":